[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/folio-arcane.png" id="3_icon"]

; Folio, John Dee's opener since 2026-11-09 (.ai/character-fit.md section 6; scripts/Folio.cs). Arcane + Darkness: the
; scholar's magic and his black mirror. Everyone else earns it with the Magpie feat (ten chests in one run).
;
; BaseDamage is ONE PAGE, on the body it cuts. BaseCooldown is the book's own turn (the ONE fire loop); every XP orb he
; gathers turns one more page at once (Player.NotifyOrbGathered). BaseProjectileCount is the pages a timed turn throws
; (plus Amount); an orb's turn is always one page. BaseRange is the reach a page looks for its quarry in. Pierce comes
; only from Gilt Edge (level 4); no level line grants it.
;
; FIRST GUESSES, untuned (Eric, 2026-11-09: no balance runs for these changes). A page's 7 sits at the top of Magic
; Missile's per-dart band (5 at level 1, 7 by level 3), since a page comes alone where a missile comes in threes.
; Spells start small: one page a turn at level 1, two at 3, three at 6. Written out in full so
; Player.EnsureRelevantLevelUps generates nothing of its own: every level adds damage, even levels shorten the turn by
; 0.1 s, and 5 adds reach. Level 8: 16 a page, three pages a turn every 1.6 s, over 340 px - and the orbs on top.

